- Do you track monthly website traffic? Options: Yes → Provide number, No → AI suggests benchmark of 5,000–10,000 visits/month for early startups
- Which channels bring most traffic? Options: Organic search, Direct, Social media, Paid ads, Referral, Email
- Typical durations: 30–60 seconds → Poor, 1–2 minutes → Good, 2–4 minutes → Excellent. What is yours?
- What is your website conversion rate? If unknown: SaaS benchmark: 1.5–3.0%, E-commerce: 1–2%
- Do you know your CAC? If not, options: 30–80 SAR (low), 80–150 SAR (medium), 150–300 SAR (high)
- If you don't measure NPS yet, we can set a target. Options: Target 30+, Target 50+, Target 60+
- Do you know your LTV? If unsure, AI calculates: LTV = ARPU × Gross Margin × Retention
- What retention rate do you want? Benchmarks: 60–70% for early SaaS, 70–85% for matured SaaS
- What is your annual revenue growth target? Options: 20–30%, 30–50%, 50–100%, 100%+ hypergrowth